\pard\ssparaaux0\s0\ql\widctlpar\plain\f0\fs22\plain\f2\fs22 Thank you for enrolling in MyUnityPoint. Please follow the instructions below to securely access your online medical record. MyUnityPoint allows you to send messages to your care team, view 
your test results, renew your prescriptions, schedule appointments, and more.\par 
\par 
\pard\ssparaaux0\s0\brdrb\brdrs\brsp20\ql\widctlpar\plain\f0\fs22\plain\f2\fs22\lang1033\hich\f2\dbch\f2\loch\f2\cf3\fs22\b  How Do I Sign Up?\par 
{\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs22\b 1.\tab}
\pard\ssparaaux0\s0\tx720\ls1\ilvl0\fi-360\li720\ql\widctlpar\plain\f0\fs22\plain\f2\fs22 In your Internet browser, go to \plain\f3\fs22\lang1033\hich\f3\dbch\f3\loch\f3\cf4\fs22\ul{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://chart.myunitypoint.org/mychart/"}{\fldrslt 
Chart.MyUnitypoint.org}}\plain\f2\fs22 .\pard\ssparaaux0\s0\tx720\ls1\ilvl0\fi-360\li720\ql\widctlpar\par 
{\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs22\b 2.\tab}
Click on the \plain\f2\fs22\lang1033\hich\f2\dbch\f2\loch\f2\fs22\b New  User?\plain\f2\fs22  link in the Sign In box. \par 
{\listtext\pard\plain\f2\fs22\b 3.\tab}
Enter your MyUnityPoint Access Code exactly as it appears below. You will not need to use this code after you have completed the sign-up process. If you do not sign up before the expiration date, you must request a new code.\par 
\pard\ssparaaux0\s0\li720\qc\plain\f0\fs22\plain\f2\fs22 MyUnityPoint Access Code:\plain\f2\fs22\lang1033\hich\f2\dbch\f2\loch\f2\fs22\b  \plain\f2\fs22\lang1033\hich\f2\dbch\f2\loch\f2\fs22\v\protect{\*\bkmkstart LINKBEGIN|320000|22|ACCESSCODE|5|||0}{\*\bkmkend 
